@startuml
title Where the decision core lives (only the modules on the decision path)

skinparam backgroundColor transparent
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #FDFDFD
  BorderColor #444444
  ArrowColor #444444
  FontName Helvetica
}
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "runtime" #F2F6FF {
  [hook] as HOOK
  [log_writer] as LOG
}

package "engine" #EEF6EE {
  [resolve] as RES
  [compound] as CMP
  [permissions] as PRM
  [permission_resolution\n(360 lines)] as PR #D6EED6
}

package "config" #FFF8E5 {
  [config\n(2 509 lines)] as CFG
  [config_types\n(verdict types)] as CT #FFEFC2
  [rule_entry] as RE
}

HOOK --> RES
HOOK --> LOG
RES --> CMP
RES --> PR
CMP --> PRM
PR --> CT
PR ..> CFG : duck-typed,\n**4 members**\nNEVER imported
CFG --> CT
CT --> RE
LOG --> CT

note right of PR
  TOO-45 D1a moved decision
  orchestration OUT of the
  ``Configuration`` class.
  ``permission_resolution``
  imports ``config_types`` and
  the stdlib -- never
  ``toolguard.config``.
end note

@enduml
